Subject: run kiod6 from /usr/lib/libexec/kf6 in its desktop entry

The daemon is installed under /usr/lib/libexec/kf6, which is on no PATH
directory, so a bare Exec=kiod6 names a program nothing can start.

--- a/src/kiod/org.kde.kiod6.desktop
+++ b/src/kiod/org.kde.kiod6.desktop
@@ -59,4 +59,4 @@
 Name[zh_TW]=KIO
 NoDisplay=true
 Icon=dialog-password
-Exec=kiod6
+Exec=/usr/lib/libexec/kf6/kiod6
